(7617377, 1233572, 81362, '<td valign="top">Fairly strong composition idea, yet the white halos along the ladder edges, often caused by sharpening technique, reduc the impact. Although I look at a title  only after viewing an image, I do find that a thoughtful title can enhance the artistic impression much more than allowing the default file name to display (even "Untitled" can often be stronger than a file name).</td>', 'Fairly strong composition idea, yet the white halos along the ladder edges, often caused by sharpening technique, reduc the impact. Although I look at a title  only after viewing an image, I do find that a thoughtful title can enhance the artistic impression much more than allowing the default file name to display (even "Untitled" can often be stronger than a file name).', '2019-03-05 21:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
