(7619076, 1233462, 3306, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lydia:</b></div><hr/><i> Come on, Larry... tell us how you did this!<br/> <br/>(BTW, congratulations!) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>it was going to snow so I put the ladder out the night before. I have bird feeders on my deck so I knew the birds would appear for breakfast. I set my camera up early and prefocused on the ladder, coaxed the blue jay to the ladder with some bird seed.  I got this capture on the first try so the snow was fresh. Lucky shot!</td>', 'Originally posted by Lydia: Come on, Larry... tell us how you did this! (BTW, congratulations!)   it was going to snow so I put the ladder out the night before. I have bird feeders on my deck so I knew the birds would appear for breakfast. I set my camera up early and prefocused on the ladder, coaxed the blue jay to the ladder with some bird seed.  I got this capture on the first try so the snow was fresh. Lucky shot!', '2019-03-11 21:22:43.000000', NULL, 0),
